<title>USA: World Airways Dec block hours rise.</title>
<headline>World Airways Dec block hours rise.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-01-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>World Airways Inc said Tuesday it recorded 4,362 block hours flown in December, an increase from 2,412 hours posted for the same period in the prior year.</p>
<p>The company said that for the year ended December 31, it recorded 43,897 block hours flown, up from 35,628 block hours for the prior year.</p>
